      "locale": "en_US",
      "tier": "tooltip",
      "text": "Teemo fires a dart, Blinding the target for 2/2.25/2.5/2.75/3 seconds and dealing (80/125/170/215/260 + (70% Ability Power)) magic damage. Minions and jungle monsters are Blinded for 200% longer.",
      "variant": null
    },
